id: pm-t4prek
title: "GH-1294: release commit omits synchronized plugin runtime manifests"
description: "The 2026-09-24 automatic pipeline synchronized plugin package.json files locally but commitAndMaybePushRelease staged an older independent manifest allowlist. Tag v2026.9.24 therefore contains root 2026.9.24 and plugin runtime pins 2026.9.23; the tag publish workflow failed six plugin tests and npm remains 2026.9.23. Unify the manifest inventory used by synchronization and Git staging, prove a bumped fixture commit contains all pins, and recover publication without moving or duplicating the existing tag."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 0
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-24T08:32:19.516Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-24T08:47:20.559Z"
assignee: "harness:codex"
claim_principal: "harness:codex#b3f990a170e3e76542ccf300"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: One authoritative distribution manifest inventory drives sync and release staging; a temporary Git release fixture proves every changed version and exact runtime pin is committed; missing or stale plugin pins fail before tagging; current tag identity is preserved and recovery disposition is explicit; full coverage static and package acceptance pass
parent: pm-u9d0
